{"4400320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nuktedan: The Forgotten Emotions", "steam_appid": 4400320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nuktedan: The Forgotten Emotions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuktedan is a small bird. He doesn't remember the shape of the cliff. He doesn't remember falling. But it hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nuktedan's world was once full of color. Now it is black and white. Because every color was a memory — and Alzheimer's took them, one by one. The memories are gone. But every memory left a trace — and those traces became puzzles. You can follow them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The core mechanic is simple: guide a laser to a cube. But the path is never simple. Every emotion you gain is not just a memory — it becomes a tool. When yellow arrives, you can rewind time. When blue arrives, you fade into shadow. When red arrives, you tear down the wall ahead. Every emotion opens a new way to see the world — and some puzzles can only be solved when you feel the right thing.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Yellow</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ability - Time Control</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Emotion - Hope</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400320/extras/b53a55d88e5aa2aa31534ed5b85f6d89.poster.avif?t=1788123377\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400320/extras/b53a55d88e5aa2aa31534ed5b85f6d89.webm?t=1788123377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400320/extras/b53a55d88e5aa2aa31534ed5b85f6d89.mp4?t=1788123377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><